21:16.880 --> 21:19.290
I cooked it with love!

21:21.110 --> 21:22.420
"Enjoy"?

21:22.420 --> 21:25.920
Enjoy the meal

21:23.430 --> 21:25.920
Oh, that's what you meant.

21:26.580 --> 21:28.150
Hm? Ah!

21:29.350 --> 21:31.490
What the heck are you doing?

21:34.340 --> 21:36.680
Now I smell all fishy...

21:37.480 --> 21:39.770
Strarf played a big part, too!

21:44.240 --> 21:45.710
I did not truly...

21:46.800 --> 21:48.910
Those octopus balls look delicious!

21:48.910 --> 21:50.980
Hina, can I have one?

21:59.800 --> 22:01.460
Thanks, Hina.

22:09.800 --> 22:17.720
{ED}

22:20.060 --> 22:26.560
I stand here reflected in your eyes

22:26.560 --> 22:31.840
and make something of a foolish face

22:32.970 --> 22:39.430
Being more gentle than the wind and invincible like the clouds

22:39.430 --> 22:44.380
I want to protect you

22:45.490 --> 22:51.930
Here in the forest I am lost in

22:51.930 --> 22:57.630
I want to try finding a four-leaf clover

22:57.630 --> 23:04.790
The sun is guiding me

23:04.790 --> 23:10.510
towards the miracles of two stars together

23:10.510 --> 23:13.700
Even if we are hurt on the way

23:13.700 --> 23:17.680
and ten years pass

23:17.680 --> 23:24.170
this future where I can be with you is what I choose

23:24.170 --> 23:25.880
We will walk on ahead

23:27.210 --> 23:30.800
and not miss the sun's sign

23:40.710 --> 23:43.610
Master, I'm glad we made you happy!

23:43.610 --> 23:45.310
The PVC apron thing didn't work too great, though.

23:45.310 --> 23:48.400
I hear that if you equip White Sock Armor onto your figure too,

23:48.820 --> 23:50.530
young boys will love it even more!

23:50.530 --> 23:51.780
<i>Where</i> do you hear these things?

23:52.990 --> 23:54.700
Lenient... far too lenient.

23:54.700 --> 23:58.200
We'll have an action-packed episode, all for Strarf!

23:58.200 --> 24:01.600
Master's gonna get mistaken for a Shinki thief! Talk about bad!

24:01.600 --> 24:04.460
And we'll find the real criminal and clear Master's name!

